        "text": "# Truth Table\n\nA **truth table** shows all possible combinations of true and false values for one or more conditions and the result of each combination.\n\n| A | B | A && B | A &#124;&#124; B |\n|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| T | T | T | T |\n| T | F | F | T |\n| F | T | F | T |\n| F | F | F | F |\n",
